          "value": "\n<ol><li dir=\"ltr\">[... and] prosper. [In good] o[rder.]\u00a0\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[...] b. ha-Kohen, witness (whose) s(oul is at) r(est). Sahl b. Rabawi, witness.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[... b.] Raj\u0101 (whose) s(oul is at) r(est), witness. Eli b. Sulh, witness. [...]\u00a0\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[...]l ha-Levi (whose) s(oul is at) r(est), witness. Toviah ha-Levi b. R. Eli ha-Levi b. Sah[l...]\u00a0\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[...]I wrote their testimony with their permission.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[...]b. m(aster) Sim\u1e25a (whose) s(oul is at) r(est), witness.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">Asher ha-\u1e25azzan b. R. E-ph-r-a-i-m. M-y h-e-l-p is the R-o-c-k.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">Ephraim ha-\u1e25azzan. </li></ol>\n",
